<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Understood. Then I shall guide you from the second arc, 'the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="めいちょう">Meicho</STYLE> Arc [Clear Sign].'<PG>
I am terribly sorry, but as I will close this world once, would you kindly launch it again?<PG>
From here on as well, I remain in your hands.<PG>
{MESOFF "-1"}
{DELETECG "プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "立木三日" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
